      value: 'Scene 4b: Dynamic Grid Field of square cells. Cells can be selected,
        created or deleted. Additional links (besides auto-generated) can be created
        or deleted (they will work like teleporters).

        Different terrain
        types can be used. Movement is allowed in all directions (diagonal one costs
        more than straight). Movecost = average sum of two cells. PathDrawer draws
        line over cells.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
